# Immutable domain state

`Document`, `VectorObject`, `SourcePath`, and their arrays are immutable. History and `sameSnapshot` depend on reference equality.

- Return the same reference when an edit changes nothing.
- Copy only the branch that changed.
- Reject non-finite numbers from the UI or SVG with `Number.isFinite`.
- Keep anchor, segment, and modifier ids valid after the edit.

```typescript
// ❌ BAD
object.transform.x += dx;
return object;

// ✅ GOOD
if (!Number.isFinite(dx) || dx === 0) {
  return object;
}
return { ...object, transform: { ...object.transform, x: object.transform.x + dx } };
```
